  - A row that rebuilds an adopted piece (`replaces.id`) joins as `<id>_TB`, with Kit/ file names carrying the id (DK_<id>_TB.fbx, DK_<id>_TB_L1.fbx...). Its generated prefab can't collide with the piece it would replace.
